<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>A curse-killing...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> is cursed?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's ridiculous! This is nothing but an old legend passed around in an insular settlement...!<PG>
Yes. If a drug called falsificaso can cure it, then it's some kind of mental illness or something, made to look like a curse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it's something handed down since long ago, it's no wonder it gets treated like a curse or a supernatural phenomenon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Calm down. This is not a curse but some kind of endemic disease.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Does everyone in the settlement know about the curse-killing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Only </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, who were little at the time, do not know. Everyone else knows."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"When </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> got like that―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">um, I mean, until she was given the drug, how did you deal with it?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That time, we shut her away in </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> secret base. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">My late mother-in-law, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Erika Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, told us to hide </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> at once, somewhere out of sight."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. There does seem to be a way to cure <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I had paid a fortune for was mainly information about Droga―<PG>
That information was data from human experiments some cult had carried out in the past.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had not managed to get all of that information, so there was likely some I didn't know about.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Most likely, this curse-killing and the drug called falsificaso were part of what I hadn't learned.<PG>
Well, none of that matters now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What matters is that I have to find <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> as soon as possible and give her the falsificaso.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On top of that, I also have to keep <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE> safe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because with <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, there's no knowing when she might creep up on <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE> like a ninja.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I came here meaning to take revenge, and now it's come to this...
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "236" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I understand the situation, more or less. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, please don't leave my side, whatever happens. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> didn't try to harm me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If I act as a shield, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you'll be safe."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But...! This is the Arata settlement's problem. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, we cannot drag you into it as well."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No... I was saved by </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That same </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> surely doesn't want to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and I will protect you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It's all right. I know </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> won't attack me."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then... please come with me to the room from before. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">There, I can put my intuition to work. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I can sense any danger to you there as well."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, let's do that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But won't it be a strain on your body...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It is not as if I will die from it, and this is no time to worry about that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Now, let's go."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "500" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間割れる暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
8:30 p.m.―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A spring breeze blew in through the gaps in the broken window.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
To be safe, I had boarded up the broken window with planks and had <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE> pull a blanket over herself so she couldn't be seen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With the window boarded up, I couldn't hear the wind at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\銃を構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\拳銃桃子.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I got the handgun ready.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have no intention of shooting <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I mean it only as a deterrent, but if worst comes to worst, I'll shoot her legs so she can't move.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE> has given her consent as well.<PG>
This space with no sound and no light―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I could hear were the breathing and heartbeats of <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE> and me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that high, ringing sound of 'silence.'<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE> poked her head out from under the blanket.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Did you sense something!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, but I should tell you, just in case: </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> has a sharper nose and sharper ears than most people, and she sees well even in the dark. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Please be careful."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Understood."</STYLE><PG>
The faint smell of gunpowder drifting from the muzzle, one you couldn't notice without bringing your nose right up to it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It came from the single test shot I had fired when I got the gun.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To think she could sniff out a smell this faint.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And if on top of that she can see in the dark―<PG>
I gripped the gun tight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just in case, I had a <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="サプレッサー">silencer</STYLE> fitted.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Doing this lowers the gun's power a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that even if the worst happens and I have to shoot, the wound will be as light as possible...<PG>
But it's strange.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By now, <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE> should have sensed the danger.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, how far ahead can your danger sense tell?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That is the problem. It varies far too much... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">As much as 10 days ahead, or as little as 10 seconds..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
10 seconds...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No... even that buys enough time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With 10 seconds, I can raise the gun and fire.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
10 minutes―
{PAUSE ""}
20 minutes―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
Before long my ears adjusted, and I could hear the wind outside as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By now it was the time when <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE> would be feeling ill. Was she all right?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間割れる暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\拳銃桃子.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Worrying about that too, I stayed on my guard and kept gripping the gun the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was gripping the gun so hard that my hand hurt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I couldn't loosen my grip.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had to be ready to identify the target and fire within 10 seconds...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
The sound of a phone vibrating―it seemed to be <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san's</STYLE> phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hah... hah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">H-Hello, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!? What about </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed to be a call from <STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If he was calling to say he had treated <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> safely, I could relax.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ電話.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"K-</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Then, all of a sudden, <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE> stood up and raised her voice into the phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Get out of there, quickly! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　They're coming! A crowd of them is coming! Get away, quickly!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n100\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Having shouted that much, <STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE> sank to the floor, all her strength gone.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Please, hold on!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What she had just said, and how frantic she was. Could it be her danger sense?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ電話.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE> picked up the phone,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hah, hah, K-</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Can you hear me!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Together with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\電話切れる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "2000" "PASS"}
but even I could hear that the call had been cut off.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...! He is in danger...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What on earth happened!? What did you see!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hah, hah... By a lot of people... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">is going to be killed...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A lot of people...!?"</STYLE><PG>
But even so, the only people here were the residents of the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The residents are suddenly trying to kill <STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE>...!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ugh... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... It is just as I thought. Something is wrong outside. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It is already spring... and yet there are no animal sounds at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">In mountains like these, you can hear nocturnal animals now and then..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What... does that mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"The animals must be </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8" RUBY="おび">Frightened</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> so badly they cannot make a sound."</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "149" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Could it be because </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> went outside in that state?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, I cannot hear them anywhere around here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I think the residents have probably scattered all over, and the animals are </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> of them."</STYLE><PG>
This must be the danger sense of wild creatures, their animal instinct.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which also means <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> hasn't been found yet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> is found, they should all come back to the settlement.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">Bloodlust..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Animals react keenly to bloodlust. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That is why they are </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that bloodlust was spread all over this area.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which meant a number of people were giving off bloodlust.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\bgm_semarikuru.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So just as </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> foresaw, the ones trying to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> are..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But for everyone to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Even today, everything was peaceful, without a single quarrel...!"</STYLE><PG>
Why? Why would they target <STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the old tradition says 'Kill the green-eyed child,' then it should be <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, the one who went mad, they're after instead.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Of course...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've got it! I finally get it!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For the first time, the people of this settlement have landed in a situation where murder by a green-eyed child―
{PAUSE ""}
a curse-killing, can actually happen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So if the residents are convinced the legend is true, and are following it by trying to kill <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>―<PG>
If they try to kill <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE> will surely shield <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then even <STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE> won't come out of it unharmed.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The residents are afraid of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That's why the one trying to protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, is their target!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"...</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, your intuition seems to be far better than mine... </STYLE>
